So This folder goes over building the Committee of Neural Networks, using the method outlined in "Welcome to n2p2 documentation"
Scaling,Pruning,Rescaling and training,
the .job files are ones ran within n2p2 to do that specific job
Clear_Directories is for whatever reason you need to purge a full directory and also to repopulate directories with subdirectories
Proccessing_Seeds.sh is a bash file that massively speeds up creating models as it automates running each sectiong for each seed within the committee
(There is only so mayn cd../ a man can do before he would snap :) )
Once this has Been created 
rmse.sh can tell you how well the model is doing by checking the you gessed it RMSE for both Forces and energies.
If adopting the active learining method (which I would strongly reccommend) the SE.py gives you the stadnard error of each step in regards to the first initial frame
GenNewFrames.sh can be ran after selecting which frames (and sticking them in a .txt file) to recompute values using VASP and then adding them to the training set.
If you want to be even cleverer and adopt the delta baselining method then you can run teh .awk file to change your data to baselined data however to do the 2 things metioned above you will have needed to go into the LAMMPS folder!
